  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 104.31 Research and development permit facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 104.31 “Research and development permit facility” means a facility authorized or requiring authorization by issuance of a research and development facility permit.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 104.25) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
